WEBVTT

00:00:27.036 --> 00:00:30.265
the socio-environmental crisis.

00:00:31.804 --> 00:00:37.304
And this requires us, all of us,
to face a choice.

00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:41.963
The choice between what matters,

00:00:41.987 --> 00:00:44.517
and what doesn’t.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.018
The choice between continuing to ignore

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:52.242
the suffering of the poorest

00:00:52.266 --> 00:00:55.452
and to abuse our common home,

00:00:55.476 --> 00:00:57.130
our planet,

00:00:57.154 --> 00:01:00.451
or engaging at every level